{
  "duration": 66.319,
  "phrases": [
    {
      "start": 0.099,
      "end": 0.28,
      "text": "So"
    },
    {
      "start": 0.699,
      "end": 1.639,
      "text": "welcome back again."
    },
    {
      "start": 2.359,
      "end": 4.219,
      "text": "Time for one more problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.859,
      "end": 6.539,
      "text": "Now, in this problem, we are given that"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.019,
      "end": 9.34,
      "text": "the speed of the boat in still water"
    },
    {
      "start": 9.939,
      "end": 11.199,
      "text": "is 12 kilometer"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.619,
      "end": 12.139,
      "text": "per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.88,
      "end": 14.399,
      "text": "Also, the speed of the stream is"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.079,
      "end": 16.299,
      "text": "3 kilometer per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.979,
      "end": 20.6,
      "text": "The question is asking us to find the downstream speed of the boat."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.1,
      "end": 22.0,
      "text": "Now, before solving,"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.459,
      "end": 24.619,
      "text": "let us understand one simple concept."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.079,
      "end": 27.719,
      "text": "Imagine the river is flowing in one direction."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.34,
      "end": 32.119,
      "text": "When the boat moves in the same direction as the river,"
    },
    {
      "start": 32.559,
      "end": 34.54,
      "text": "the stream helps the boat move faster,"
    },
    {
      "start": 35.219,
      "end": 36.819,
      "text": "so both the speeds get added."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.2,
      "end": 38.699,
      "text": "This is the basic rule to remember."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.299,
      "end": 44.459,
      "text": "Downstream speed is equal to speed in still water plus speed of the stream."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.799,
      "end": 45.179,
      "text": "Got it?"
    },
    {
      "start": 45.7,
      "end": 46.159,
      "text": "Perfect."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.659,
      "end": 49.179,
      "text": "Now let us put the given values into the formula."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.759,
      "end": 53.199,
      "text": "Downstream speed is equal to 12 plus"
    },
    {
      "start": 53.5,
      "end": 53.599,
      "text": "3."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.219,
      "end": 57.779,
      "text": "After adding them, we get 15 kilometer per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 58.419,
      "end": 66.319,
      "text": "So the downstream speed of the boat is 15 kilometer per hour. Hence, the correct answer is option B."
    }
  ],
